  - "Erlik Han'\u0131n g\xF6lgesi bu kez kazand\u0131..."
  - "Kut Oca\u011F\u0131'n\u0131n ate\u015Fi seni geri \xE7a\u011F\u0131r\u0131yor."
  deathSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b19f2a6b9ae63e5aacb7c94f73905d5, type: 3}
  screenSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 94ccda102efefef6ca7fe0b0934a0e14, type: 3}
